<title>NETHERLANDS: Twentsche Kabel buys German cable firm.</title>
<headline>Twentsche Kabel buys German cable firm.</headline>
<dateline>HAAKSBERGEN, Netherlands 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twentsche Kabel Holding said on Friday it had acquired German cable wholesaler Witt+Arnold Spezial Kabel effective January 1.  </p>
<p>&quot;Witt+Arnold will make a contribution to profits in 1997 and will be paid for from the available financial resources,&quot; Twentsche Kabel said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the acquisition fitted with its strategy of expanding its trading activities on the German market.</p>
<p>Witt+Arnold books annual turnover of some 20 million guilders and is based in Iserlohn, near Dortmund.</p>
